{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest victory and cut down your foes with the Wheat Weapon Skin Set. This skin can be applied to six different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wheat Weapon Skin can be equipped in the Loadout menu for the Security faction for the following weapons:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rifleman: G36K</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Breacher: Saiga12</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Advisor: MK 17 MOD 0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gunner: M60</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Marksman: TAC 338</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Secondary: PF940</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These items are unlocked in-game immediately upon purchase and can be combined with other cosmetic gear pieces. They can be equipped in-game in the Customization menu, which can be accessed from the main menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wheat Weapon Skin Set is included in the Shell Shock Set Bundle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801250?t=1761062605","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801250/e4c3d10c12dc265be95d20ff27dbe5929fa2e4cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761062605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801250/8c676a66b59e047116c652315cdeea272faf71cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761062605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801250/8c676a66b59e047116c652315cdeea272faf71cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761062605","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descr